<title>USA: BOXING-AKINWANDE RETAINS WBO HEAVYWEIGHT TITLE.</title>
<headline>BOXING-AKINWANDE RETAINS WBO HEAVYWEIGHT TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>LAS VEGAS 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Henry Akinwande of Britain retained his World Boxing Organisation heavyweight title when the referee stopped his scheduled 12-round bout against Russian Alexandr Zolkin on cuts at 2:32 of the 10th round on Saturday.</p>
</text>
